\engtitle{.. Anubhava Nivedanam ..}##
\itxtitle{.. anubhavanivedanam ..}##\endtitles ##
antarlakShyavilInachittapavano yogI yadA vartate
     dR^iShTyA nishchalatArayA bahirasau pashyannapashyannapi |
mudreyaM khalu shAmbhavI bhavati sA yuShmatprasAdAdguro
     shUnyAshUnyavivarjitaM bhavati yat tattvaM padaM shAmbhavam || 1||
ardhoddhATitalochanaH sthiramanA nAsAgradattekShaNa\-
     shchandrArkAvapi lInatAmupagatau trispandabhAvAntare |
jyotIrUpamasheShabAhyarahitaM chaikaM pumAMsaM paraM
     tattvaM tatpadameti vastu paramaM vAchyaM kimatrAdhikam || 2||
shabdaH kashchana yo mukhAdudayate mantraH sa lokottaraH
     saMsthAnaM sukhaduHkhajanmavapuSho yatkApi mudraiva sA |
prANasya svarasena yatpravahaNaM yogaH sa evAdbhutaH
     shAktaM dhAma paraM mamAnubhavataH kinnAma na bhrAjate || 3||
mantraH sa pratibhAti varNarachanA yasminna saMlakShyate
     mudrA sA samudeti yatra galitA kR^itsnA kriyA kAyikI |
yogaH sa prathate yataH pravahaNaM prANasya sa.nkShIyate
     tvaddhAmAdhigamotsaveShu sudhiyAM kiM kiM na nAmAdbhutam || 4||

|| iti shrIabhinavaguptapAdAchAryakR^itaM anubhavanivedanaM sampUrNam ||

